{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12242090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12242090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1224209001:0":{"text":"다들 멈춰! 너희의 낡아빠진 노점을 정리하러 온 게 아니니까!","source_cn":"都住手！我不是来替你们收拾烂摊子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25575DEFAAE1AF24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224209002:0":{"text":"잘 들어. 블러디 로즈는 부두를 독점하려는 게 아니야. 두목은 러스트 항을 다시 부흥시키려고 하신다!","source_cn":"码头上的工人都听好了：血薇帮不会独占码头，我们当家的是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0C2080963DEC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224209003:0":{"text":"우리는 작업반장을 몇 명 보냈을 뿐이고, 전부 다 너희가 부두에서 먹고 살아야 한다는 걸 고려해서 내린 결정이라고!","source_cn":"我们只派了几个工头，是有考虑到你们还要靠码头吃饭的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE498ECA519B83E92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224209004:0":{"text":"그런데 고맙게 여기기는커녕 공사를 방해해? 항구가 개방되지 않고 계속 봉쇄된 상태이길 바라는 건가?","source_cn":"你们不领情，还在这里阻碍施工！怎么，不想港口开放，就想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4F0261748E512F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224209005:0":{"text":"...다 쓸데없는 헛소리!","source_cn":"——净说没用的屁话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF45F96B5A752B329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224209006:0":{"text":"러스트 항이 이렇게 된 것도 전부 너희 블러디 로즈 때문이잖아! 애초에 봉쇄령도 너희가 내린 것 아닌가? 그래놓고 이제 와서 항구를 재건하겠다고?","source_cn":"锈锚港现在这德行，不都归功于你们血薇帮吗！当初下令封锁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802CBD3D6BF1BD5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224209007:0":{"text":"맞아! 너흰 항상 너희가 옳은 일을 한다고 하지만, 우리 같은 일꾼들은 어디다 하소연을 하라는 거지?","source_cn":"就是这个理！你们永远有理，我们一帮只知道卖力气的大老粗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B23B125D1C0C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224209008:0":{"text":"너희가 아니었다면, 우리 가족들은 선단을 따라서 큰 장사를 할 수도 있었을 거야! 그러면 온 가족이 잘살 수 있었을 텐데!","source_cn":"要不是你们，我的家人兄弟就能跟着船队出海，说不定还能做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7E7029FF408BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224209009:0":{"text":"멍청한 것들...\n해상 무역이 조개 잡는 것처럼 쉬운 일인 줄 알아?!","source_cn":"你这个野蛮人……\\n真当出海贸易和下海捞贝壳一样简单？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x310A0DB6721BF4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224209010:0":{"text":"얼마나 많은 배와 사람들이 러스트 항으로 돌아오지 못했는지 알아? 게다가 죽음의 함대도 있었잖아! 그들에게 잡힌 사람 중에 무사히 돌아온 게 몇이나 있었지?!","source_cn":"多少船只没有返航，多少人没命回到锈锚港……更别提之前还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9C166BEADC62FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224209011:0":{"text":"죽고 싶다면 블러디 로즈는 막지 않겠어. 하지만 러스트 항을 그들 마음대로 하게 둘 순 없지!","source_cn":"你愿意去送命，血薇帮不管！但整个锈锚港，不能交由他们处置！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3654ADEEF33947A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224209012:0":{"text":"너...!","source_cn":"你——！<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363B2E26B15866F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224209013:0":{"text":"마, 맞는 말이긴 하지만 그렇게 말할 것까지야...","source_cn":"虽……虽然你说的话有道理，但话也不能这么说吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6440A4B35808D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1224209013":{"text":"마, 맞는 말이긴 하지만 그렇게 말할 것까지야...","source_cn":"虽……虽然你说的话有道理，但话也不能这么说吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6440A4B35808D0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224209014:0":{"text":"쳇, 명분도 챙기고 부두도 손에 넣겠다 이거군!","source_cn":"哼，大道理都让你们说了，码头也让你们占了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F87997E44D0EFDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1224209015:0":{"text":"됐어, 당신들과 말다툼할 시간 없으니까.","source_cn":"够了，我没空和你们争辩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE28B4C7ABE09051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1224209016:0":{"text":"목재는 모두 옮겨놨어. 웨일런, 바로 사람들을 데리고 가서 부두를 수리해. 시간을 낭비하며 싸우는 모습을 또 본다면 용서하지 않겠어!","source_cn":"木材都运到了。韦兰，你赶快带人去修码头。别再让我抓到你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB21088DD63A39184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1224209017:0":{"text":"부두 근로자들은... 협조하지 않겠다면 쉬게 둬. 다른 사람을 보내줄 테니까.","source_cn":"至于这些码头工人——不乐意配合，那就让他们歇着。我再给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B23D634610A45F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1224209018:0":{"text":"네, 바로 시작하겠습니다!","source_cn":"是，我这就让弟兄们开始干！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2947AAD9EE2DEBDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1224209019:0":{"text":"그, 그럼 부두일을 너희가 전부 한다고 하면 나중에 누가 우리를 찾겠어?","source_cn":"这……码头上的活儿要是都被你们干了，以后谁还来找我们啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE530925BFA7F2888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1224209020:0":{"text":"나, 나도 도울거야!","source_cn":"我、我也来帮你们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7DE0D35E7C915DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1224210001:":{"text":"손발 놀리지 말고! 더 빠르게 움직여!","source_cn":"手脚都麻利点！动作快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C1E5E66E52E41B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1224210002:":{"text":"게으름 피울 생각 마. 내가 다 지켜보고 있다고!","source_cn":"别想偷懒，我盯着你们呢","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD99CD090640E1ABB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1224210003:":{"text":"목재 옮기는 걸 도와주러 왔어!","source_cn":"我来帮你们搬木材！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3E46EBB471F2535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1224210004:":{"text":"죠킨스, 이 못난 자식...!","source_cn":"约坎斯这个没出息的家伙……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA19BA68E25BFFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:35:12051216:0":{"text":"부두 근로자들의 항의가 진정되었고, 일꾼들은 질서 있게 일을 하기 시작했다.","source_cn":"码头工人的抗议暂时平息，工人们开始有序地工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9BED97AA587808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"네 말이 내 말이야","source_cn":"听你一席话，如听一席话","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F9A5BB331D178A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네 말이 내 말이야","female":"네 말이 내 말이야","variant_male_record_index":"67780","variant_female_record_index":"67781","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"블러디 로즈도 러스트 항을 위해서 하는 일이야","source_cn":"血薇帮也是为了锈锚港","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x173B0EFAFB985BEE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"블러디 로즈도 러스트 항을 위해서 하는 일이야","female":"블러디 로즈도 러스트 항을 위해서 하는 일이야","variant_male_record_index":"67782","variant_female_record_index":"67783","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:血薇帮贝拉":{"text":"벨라","source":"血薇帮贝拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:码头工人恩佐":{"text":"부두 근로자 엔초","source":"码头工人恩佐","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:码头工人约坎斯":{"text":"부두 근로자 죠킨스","source":"码头工人约坎斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮工头韦兰":{"text":"작업반장 웨일런","source":"血薇帮工头韦兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":33,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":5}}